# Workflow logging

Provide appropriate status logging throughout, along with commenting the workflow.

- Log clear progress updates at meaningful steps (start, key actions, completion, errors)
- Add brief comments only where the workflow or business logic isn't obvious from the code
- Don't comment the obvious; explain *why*, not *what*
- Keep logs and comments concise and useful for debugging or follow-up work
